  "citation": null,
  "measurementTechnique": "Census enumeration of Florida counties and incorporated places, joined by normalised name to the public metadata APIs of the commercial codifiers, with every resulting URL verified against the publisher's own resolver rather than an HTTP status. Jurisdictions no codifier carries were resolved by hand in a browser and recorded separately. Metadata only; no ordinance text is retrieved or republished.",
  "distribution": [
    {
      "@type": "DataDownload",
